### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:4000/api/posts
Accept: application/json

### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:4000/api/posts?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5&searchTerm=typescript&dateFrom=2025-01-01
Accept: application/json



### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:4000/api/posts?searchTerm=post
Accept: application/json



### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:4000/api/posts?pageNumber=2&pageSize=5&searchTerm=typescript&dateFrom=2024-01-01
Accept: application/json



### Get post by id
GET http://localhost:4000/api/posts/2
Accept: application/json


### Create post
POST http://localhost:4000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Post 2",
    "content": "Content of post 1"
}


### Update post
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Post 1 updated",
    "content": "Content of post 1 updated"
}


### Delete post
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/posts/1
